firstReview.body:
Instead of reading `History` off of a Commit object, you can read its `oid` field which will be the commit SHA.

```graphql
query ($repoOwner: String!, $repoName: String!) {
	repository(owner: $repoOwner, name: $repoName) {
		defaultBranchRef {
			name
			target {
				... on Commit {
					oid
					messageHeadline
				}
			}
		}
	}
}
```
